      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "And the Lord commanded a great sea creature to swallow Jonah. And Jonah was inside the sea creature for three days and three nights."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/coptic-nt/jonah#Jonah.3.1",
      "source_sha256": "7a66e397e4d41fa1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "And the word of the Lord came to Jonah a second time, saying to him:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/coptic-nt/jonah#Jonah.3.5",
      "source_sha256": "a391ac7ddb1c9346",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "The people of Nineveh believed God, proclaimed a fast, and put on sackcloth, from the greatest to the least."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "scripture/coptic-nt/jonah#Jonah.4.11",
      "source_sha256": "6509ff8af467bb41",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 4,
      "text": "So should I not have pity on Nineveh, the great city, in which there are more than a hundred and twenty thousand people who do not know their right hand from their left, and many animals?"
    }
  ]
}
